### =====================================================
### Biometric Disable - POST /account/biometric/disable
### Desactiva el flag biométrico por app (bitmask
### Users.BiometricEnabledApps)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Desactivar biometría para la app 22 (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/biometric/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationIdentity": 22
}

### Test 2: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/biometric/disable
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationIdentity": 22
}

### Test 3: Valor inválido (applicationIdentity no numérico) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/biometric/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationIdentity": "abc"
}
